OL,3,ATurkish police raid opposition TV
OL,4,Astation, halting live broadcasts
OL,5,
OL,6,FTurkish police have raided the
OL,7,Fheadquarters of a pro-opposition TV
OL,8,Fchannel, halting its live broadcasts.
OL,10,FHalk TV said its employees were unable
OL,11,Fto enter the building in Istanbul on
OL,12,FWednesday morning, and that a new
OL,13,Fmanager had been appointed to run the
OL,14,Fchannel.
OL,16,FReports in Turkish media said financial
OL,17,Fcrimes police were searching the
OL,18,Fbuilding and 11 people had been taken
OL,19,Finto custody in the raid linked to the
OL,20,Fchannel's owner.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
