OL,3,ATurkish police raid opposition TV
OL,4,Astation, halting live broadcasts
OL,5,
OL,6,FHalk TV has been seen by many in the
OL,7,Fcountry as being close to the
OL,8,Fopposition Republican People's Party
OL,9,F(CHP). It often voices criticism of
OL,10,FPresident Recep Tayyip ErdoD_an's
OL,11,Fruling AK party.
